    feat(tui): restructure status panel into a turn/phase tree
    
    - replace the raw event-log with a Tree: turn → phase nodes with per-phase
      timing and a tool-call rollup (e.g. read_file×2)
    - completed turns collapse to ✓/✗ with elapsed and verdict
    - move ephemeral feedback (slash commands, mcp load) to toast notifications
    - surface empty-final/length-truncation as a clear failure node + error toast
    - add Codex-style elapsed format (4m 07s) and tool rollup to the activity bar
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

